(Doc-ID: TRV-POL-003) Tj T*
(Title: Travel and Expense Policy) Tj T*
(Category: Finance) Tj T*
(Version: 4.0) Tj T*
(Status: effective) Tj T*
(Effective: 2025-03-01) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SYNTHETIC DEMO DOCUMENT. Orion Synthetic Industries \(OSI\) is fictional.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1 PURPOSE AND SCOPE) Tj T*
(This policy sets the rules for booking business travel and claiming travel expenses at OSI. It) Tj T*
(applies to all employees and contractors who travel on company business.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 BOOKING TRAVEL) Tj T*
(All flights and hotels must be booked through the TravelDesk portal. Economy class is required) Tj T*
(for flights shorter than 6 hours. Business class may be used for flights of 6 hours or longer,) Tj T*
(but only with prior approval from a Vice President \(VP\).) Tj T*
(Trips must be approved by the line manager before booking. International trips also require) Tj T*
(approval from the department head at least 14 days before departure.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
