(3 PER DIEM ALLOWANCE \(PDA\)) Tj T*
(Travellers receive a Per Diem Allowance \(PDA\) to cover meals and incidental expenses. The PDA) Tj T*
(for domestic travel is USD 75 per day. The PDA for international travel is USD 120 per day.) Tj T*
(The PDA is not paid for days on which meals are provided by a conference or client.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 ACCOMMODATION) Tj T*
(The maximum hotel rate is USD 220 per night for domestic travel and USD 300 per night for) Tj T*
(international travel. Rates above the cap require written approval from the department head) Tj T*
(before booking.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
