(5 EXPENSE CLAIMS) Tj T*
(Expense claims must be submitted in the ExpenseHub system within 30 days of returning from the) Tj T*
(trip. Receipts are required for every item above USD 25.) Tj T*
(Claims submitted more than 60 days after the trip require approval from the Finance Director) Tj T*
(and may be rejected.) Tj T*
(Personal expenses, fines and upgrades without approval are never reimbursed.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
